# TWO statements, because in MT940 the blast radius of a bad line is the
# STATEMENT, not the line: the per-line balance is derived from the :60F:
# chain, so one unreadable :61: makes every balance after it a guess.
# Statement 1 (STMT260801099) carries six defective lines and therefore emits
# nothing at all -- six row-level quarantines plus one statement-level one.
# Statement 2 (STMT260820001) is clean and still yields its two BankLines,
# which is the whole point of scoping the damage.
